  "worked_solution": "Notice that our inequality\n\n$$\n-{x}^{2}+25>0,\n$$\n\nis a \"*greater than*\" inequality. Therefore, we need to find the values of $x$ for which the parabola\n\n$$\ny=-{x}^{2}+25\n$$\n\n \nis *above* the $x$-axis. We mark these values of $x$ in blue in the diagram below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972108/assets/b6b9353c183dee60c1f2df89d4b6ea3d47aa81a9030be9113a11d0b9c61c7682.png)\n\nSo, the solution to the inequality is $-5<x<5.$",
